/// Associates the specified KMS key with either one log group in the
/// account, or with all stored CloudWatch Logs query insights results in
/// the account. When you use AssociateKmsKey , you specify either the
/// logGroupName parameter or the resourceIdentifier parameter. You can't
/// specify both of those parameters in the same operation. Specify the
/// logGroupName parameter to cause log events ingested into that log group
